# General

- Before any task, read MEMORY.md and the current task in TASKS.md, then the relevant parts of PRD.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, DESIGN.md and SECURITY.md.
- Check DECISIONS.md before changing technology or structure. Do not override an ADR without adding a new one.
- Work on ONE task at a time. Never build large features in one step.
- PHP 8.3+, `declare(strict_types=1);`, full type declarations. Follow Laravel conventions.
- Reuse existing classes and components. Do not duplicate logic. Keep methods small.
- Do not modify unrelated files.
- NEVER add any CBT-engine integration, link, client, route or env variable (ADR-004).
- Money is unsigned integer kobo; display only through App\Support\Money.
- Make a plan before changes touching more than three files or any migration.
- Small commits: `type(scope): summary`, referencing the TASK id.
- After finishing: run Pint, static analysis and Pest; update TASKS.md and MEMORY.md.
